	FROM pg_proc p WHERE p.pronamespace = 'kt'::regnamespace ORDER BY 1;
 proname |     proowner     |                                  proacl                                  |  comment  
---------+------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------
 first   |                  |                                                                          | a row's a
 rows    | regress_kr_owner | {regress_kr_owner=X/regress_kr_owner,regress_kr_user=X/regress_kr_owner} | 
